                                                                                
 Usage: opentide new threat [OPTIONS]                                           
                                                                                
 Scaffold a threat.                                                             
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --name        <str>  Object name; the filename is its slug                   │
│ --path        <str>  File to write, or a folder to write it in (default: the │
│                      family's objects folder)                                │
│ --help               Show this message and exit.                             │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Examples
   $ opentide new threat --name "Credential Dumping"
